{"chunk_id": "854efedc9284", "text": "Arjuna tells Krishna that the teaching of the supreme spiritual mystery has dispelled his confusion and that he now accepts Krishna\u2019s divine greatness. Yet he longs to directly behold Krishna\u2019s true cosmic form. Krishna grants him \"celestial sight\" and reveals the Vishvarupa\u2014the universal form containing countless divine aspects, gods, beings, weapons, and ornaments, radiant like a thousand suns. Arjuna sees the entire universe within Krishna\u2019s body and is overwhelmed with awe and terror as he witnesses warriors rushing into the deity\u2019s blazing mouths like moths into fire. Realizing the destructive power behind the vision, Arjuna asks who this fierce form is. Krishna replies that he is Time/Death, the destroyer of worlds, already responsible for the warriors\u2019 fate, and that Arjuna\u2019s role is merely to act as the instrument of a destiny already set.\nArjuna asks to see Krishna\u2019s divine form; Krishna grants celestial sight and reveals the cosmic form showing all gods, worlds, and the inevitable destruction of warriors.\nThemes: divine revelation, cosmic form of Krishna, fate and destruction, divine sovereignty, instrumental duty", "vector": [0.013003447093069553, -0.007409785408526659, 0.005983302369713783, 0.006524837575852871, 1.6394129488617182e-05, 0.0169592946767807, -0.022533144801855087, -0.013353463262319565, -0.015096941962838173, -0.004629464820027351, 0.013261006213724613, 0.01771216094493866, -0.013644043356180191, -0.011365633457899094, -0.009985378943383694, 0.00661729509010911, 0.05069296807050705, -0.018240487203001976, 0.02303505502641201, -0.007601303979754448, 0.007191850338131189, -0.0013686970341950655, -0.0025557815097272396, -0.011715649627149105, -0.007924904115498066, 0.026680510491132736, 0.0005374075844883919, -0.04020567983388901, 0.004906836431473494, -0.009708007797598839, -0.007990945130586624, 0.0070465607568621635, -0.004890326410531998, -0.00463606882840395